iate Layer Distillation (MNLI, QQP, QNLI)': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['The batch size used for intermediate layer distillation on the augmented dataset for tasks like MNLI, QQP, and QNLI, which is 256.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'Learning Rate for BERT Pre-training': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['The learning rate used during the BERT pre-training, which is kept the same as BERT pre-training (Devlin et al., 2018).'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'Epochs for General Distillation': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['The number of epochs used for general distillation, which is 3 epochs.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'Text Corpus for General Distillation': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['The text corpus used for general distillation, which is English Wikipedia (2,500M words).'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'BERT-PKD Baseline Layers': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['The number of layers used for the BERT-PKD baseline, which is 4.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'DistilBERT Baseline Layers': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['The number of layers used for the DistilBERT baseline, which is 4.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'BERT-PKD Learning Rate': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['The learning rate used for training the BERT-PKD baseline (not explicitly mentioned in the text, but implied to follow the original BERT work).'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'DistilBERT Learning Rate': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['The learning rate used for training the DistilBERT baseline (not explicitly mentioned in the text, but implied to follow the original BERT work).'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'BERT-PKD Batch Size': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['The batch size used for training the BERT-PKD baseline (not explicitly mentioned in the text, but implied to follow the original BERT work).'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'DistilBERT Batch Size': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['The batch size used for training the DistilBERT baseline (not explicitly mentioned in the text, but implied to follow the original BERT work).'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'SQuAD v1.1': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A question answering dataset used to evaluate the performance of TinyBERT.'], 'source_chunk_index': [4]}, 'SQuAD v2.0': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['Another question answering dataset used to evaluate the performance of TinyBERT.'], 'source_chunk_index': [4]}, 'Question answering (QA)': {'type': ['task'], 'description': ['The task of answering questions based on given context, used to evaluate TinyBERT.'], 'source_chunk_index': [4]}, 'TheStanford Sentiment Treebank': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A binary single-sentence classification dataset used to predict the sentiment of movie reviews.'], 'source_chunk_index': [4]}, 'Transformer distillation': {'description': ['A novel method proposed for knowledge distillation of Transformer-based models, used to transfer knowledge from a large teacher model (BERT) to a smaller student model (TinyBERT).', 'A knowledge distillation method specifically designed for Transformer-based models, used to transfer knowledge from teacher BERT to student TinyBERT.', 'The process of transferring knowledge from a teacher Transformer model to a student Transformer model at the layer level.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1]}, 'Knowledge distillation (KD)': {'description': ['A technique used to transfer knowledge from a larger, more complex model (teacher) to a smaller, simpler model (student).'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 4]}, 'Knowledge Distillation (KD)': {'description': ['A method used to transfer knowledge from a larger, more complex model (teacher) to a smaller, more efficient model (student).'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 2, 4]}, 'Multi-head attention (MHA)': {'description': ['A sub-layer within the Transformer architecture that allows the model to attend to different parts of the input sequence.', 'A sub-layer within a Transformer layer that allows the model to attend to different parts of the input sequence. It calculates a weighted sum of values, where the weights are computed using the softmax function applied to the attention matrices.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Attention matrix (A)': {'description': ['A matrix used in the Transformer model to capture the relationships between different words in the input sequence.', 'The matrix used in the multi-head attention mechanism to calculate the attention weights. It captures the relationships between different parts of the input sequence.', 'The matrix used in the multi-head attention mechanism to calculate the attention weights. It captures the relationships between different parts of the input sequence.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Embedding-layer distillation': {'description': ['A distillation technique applied to the embedding layer of the Transformer model.', 'The process of transferring knowledge from a teacher Transformer model to a student Transformer model at the embedding layer.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Prediction-layer distillation': {'description': ['A distillation technique applied to the prediction layer of the Transformer model.', 'The process of transferring knowledge from a teacher Transformer model to a student Transformer model at the prediction layer.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'General distillation': {'description': ['The first stage of the two-stage learning framework, performed on text from the general domain, to help student TinyBERT learn the rich knowledge embedded in teacher BERT.', 'A procedure within the TinyBERT learning framework, involving pre-training and knowledge transfer from a teacher model.', 'A method proposed for initializing TinyBERT, where it learns knowledge from intermediate layers of the teacher BERT during pre-training.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 3, 4]}, 'Task-specific distillation': {'description': ['The second stage of the two-stage learning framework, used to derive competitive fine-tuned TinyBERTs for downstream tasks.', "The objective of improving TinyBERT's performance on specific NLP tasks by focusing on task-specific knowledge.", 'A distillation approach focused on transferring knowledge relevant to specific tasks.', 'A key procedure within the TinyBERT learning framework, focused on distilling knowledge specific to a particular task.'], 'type': ['task', 'method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 2, 3, 4]}, 'Multi-head Attention (MHA)': {'description': ['A sub-layer within a Transformer layer that allows the model to attend to different parts of the input sequence simultaneously. It calculates a weighted sum of values, where the weights are computed using the softmax function applied to the attention matrices.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Fully Connected Feed-forward Network (FFN)': {'description': ['Another sub-layer within a Transformer layer, consisting of two linear transformations and a ReLU activation function. It processes the output of the multi-head attention layer.', 'Another sub-layer within a Transformer layer, consisting of two linear transformations and a ReLU activation function.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Embedding Layer Distillation': {'description': ['A distillation technique applied to the embedding layer of the Transformer model, aiming to transfer knowledge from the teacher model to the student model regarding how to represent the input tokens.', 'The process of transferring knowledge from a teacher Transformer model to a student Transformer model at the embedding layer.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Prediction Layer Distillation': {'description': ['A distillation technique applied to the prediction layer of the Transformer model, aiming to transfer knowledge from the teacher model to the student model regarding the final output or prediction.', 'A knowledge distillation technique applied to the prediction layer of the student model, transferring knowledge from the teacher model.', 'The process of transferring knowledge from a teacher Transformer model to a student Transformer model at the prediction layer.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 3]}, 'Attention-based Distillation': {'description': ['A distillation method that uses the attention matrix as the fitting target to transfer linguistic knowledge from the teacher BERT to the student TinyBERT.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Data Augmentation': {'description': ['A method used to extend the task-specific training set, involving word-level replacement using BERT and GloVe embeddings.', 'A procedure within the TinyBERT learning framework, used to augment the dataset.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [2, 3]}, 'General Distillation': {'description': ['The first stage of the two-stage distillation process, providing a good initialization for the task-specific distillation.', 'A procedure within the TinyBERT learning framework, involving pre-training and knowledge transfer from a teacher model.', 'A method proposed for initializing TinyBERT, where it learns knowledge from intermediate layers of the teacher BERT during pre-training.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [2, 3, 4]}, 'Task-Specific Distillation': {'description': ['The second stage of the two-stage distillation process, which further improves TinyBERT by focusing on learning the task-specific knowledge.', 'A key procedure within the TinyBERT learning framework, focused on distilling knowledge specific to a particular task.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [2, 3]}}
